artifacts/mg04-review/
artifacts/mg05-review/
artifacts/mg06-review/
artifacts/ce00-baseline/
dist-kiosk/

# Rewrite build output
apps/*/dist/
apps/web/public/media/
apps/exhibit/public/data/
apps/exhibit/test-results/
